{"type": "result", "subtype": "success", "is_error": false, "duration_ms": 3500, "result": "<vocal>Voici l'architecture. [[1]] Les requêtes arrivent sur le serveur, [[2]] qui interroge la base, [[3]] et le cache évite une lecture sur deux.</vocal>\n\n```html apercu scene=archi\n<style>\nbody{margin:0;padding:14px 16px;font:13px/1.4 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#ECECF1;background:#0C0D10}\n.r{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.b{padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid #3A3D4A;border-radius:8px;background:#16171C;opacity:.22;transition:opacity .3s,border-color .3s,color .3s}\n.b.on{opacity:1;border-color:#B3A1FF}\n.f{width:30px;height:2px;background:#3A3D4A;opacity:.22;transition:opacity .3s}\n.f.on{opacity:1;background:#B3A1FF}\n.col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\n.b.panne{border-color:#FF8A8A;color:#FF8A8A;text-decoration:line-through}\n#note{margin-top:12px;color:#B3B6C2;min-height:1.4em}\n</style>\n<div class=\"r\">\n  <div class=\"b\" data-e=\"0\">Client</div><div class=\"f\" data-e=\"1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"b\" data-e=\"1\">Serveur</div><div class=\"f\" data-e=\"2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"col\"><div class=\"b\" id=\"base\" data-e=\"2\">Base</div><div class=\"b\" id=\"cache\" data-e=\"3\">Cache</div></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"note\"></div>\n<script>\nconst notes = [\"Une requête arrive.\", \"Le serveur la traite.\", \"Il lit la base.\", \"Le cache répond à une lecture sur deux.\"];\njarvis.etape(n => {\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-e]').forEach(x => x.classList.toggle('on', +x.dataset.e <= n));\n  document.getElementById('note').textContent = notes[n] || '';\n});\n</script>\n```\n\n✅ Schéma de l'architecture affiché.", "session_id": "5e55a0c0-0000-4000-8000-0000000scene"}
